            "creator": "seb.meyer",
            "bug_id": 19302,
            "text": "Something is wrong now: R-devel CMD build in the following example warns about the minimum R version even if that is already specified high enough.\n\n```\nsetwd(tempdir())\npkgdir <- package.skeleton(list = \"pi\")\ncat(\"Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)\\n\", append = TRUE,\n    file = file.path(pkgdir, \"DESCRIPTION\"))\ntools::Rcmd(c(\"build\", pkgdir))\n```\n```\n...\n  WARNING: Added dependency on R >= 3.5.0 because serialized objects in\n  serialize/load version 3 cannot be read in older versions of R.\n  File(s) containing such objects:\n    'anRpackage/data/pi.rda'\n* building 'anRpackage_1.0.tar.gz'\n```\n\n(It did not actually change the existing 'Depends' specification.)",
            "is_markdown": true,
            "count": 3
          },
          {
            "creator": "ikrylov",
            "creation_time": "2026-11-27T12:56:41Z",
            "text": "My apologies. I made a mistake in the condition for the `if (!hasDep450) { ... if (length(need350)) {` branch:\n\n```\nIndex: src/library/tools/R/build.R\n===================================================================\n--- src/library/tools/R/build.R\t(revision 90998)\n+++ src/library/tools/R/build.R\t(working copy)\n@@ -1224,7 +1224,7 @@\n             allfiles <- substring(allfiles, 3L)  # drop './'\n             vers  <- get_serialization_version(allfiles)\n             need350 <- names(vers[vers >= 3L])\n-            if (length(need350)) {\n+            if (!hasDep350 && length(need350)) {\n                 fixup_R_dep(pkgname, \"3.5.0\")\n                 msg <- paste(\"WARNING: Added dependency on R >= 3.5.0 because\",\n                              \"serialized objects in serialize/load version 3\",\n```\n\nNow tested with `LC_ALL=C.UTF-8 TZ=UTC make check-all` as well.\n\nIs it worth refactoring the code further to produce less messages in the following case?\n\n```\nsetwd(tempdir())\npkgdir <- package.skeleton(list = character())\ndir.create(file.path(pkgdir, 'data'))\nsave(pi, file=file.path(pkgdir, 'data', 'pi350.rda'), version = 3)\nsave(pi, file=file.path(pkgdir, 'data', 'pi450.rda'), version = 2, compress = 'zstd')\ntools::Rcmd(c(\"build\", pkgdir))\n```\n```\n  NB: this package now depends on R (>= 3.5.0)\n  WARNING: Added dependency on R >= 3.5.0 because serialized objects in\n  serialize/load version 3 cannot be read in older versions of R.\n  File(s) containing such objects:\n    ‘anRpackage/data/pi350.rda’\n  NB: this package now depends on R (>= 4.5.0)\n  WARNING: Added dependency on R >= 4.5.0 because zstd-compressed\n  serialized objects cannot be read in older versions of R.\n  File(s) containing such objects:\n    ‘anRpackage/data/pi450.rda’\n```\n(The end result is `Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)` thanks to `fixup_R_dep()` consuming the now-extraneous dependency.)",
            "bug_id": 19302,
            "is_markdown": true,
            "count": 4,
            "attachment_id": {},
            "tags": [],
            "time": "2026-11-27T12:56:41Z",
