            "time": "2026-11-27T14:25:12Z",
            "creation_time": "2026-11-27T14:25:12Z",
            "count": 5,
            "bug_id": 19302,
            "text": "Thanks. Patched in r91001.\n\n(In reply to Ivan Krylov from comment #4)\n> Is it worth refactoring the code further to produce less messages\n\nMore messages are more annoying so maintainers are more likely to update their DESCRIPTION. ;) It is also nice to see which features trigger specific version requirements. So I think these messages are OK.",
            "tags": [],
            "is_private": false,
            "id": 104546
          },
          {
            "count": 6,
            "is_markdown": true,
            "bug_id": 19302,
            "text": "There is another problem.\nFor CRAN package 'representer', R CMD check now gives\n\n* checking data for ASCII and uncompressed saves ... WARNING\n  Note: significantly better compression could be obtained\n        by using R CMD build --resave-data\n                   old_size new_size compress\n  linkage.rl.RData    894Kb    791Kb     zstd\n\nGiven that \n\n     \\item \\code{libzstd} is required.  For \\R 4.7.0 only, this can be\n      circumvented by configuring with \\option{--without-libzstd}.\n\nI think we should skip zstd from the possible compressions for another 2 years or so?",
            "creation_time": "2026-11-27T15:37:29Z",
            "creator": "Kurt.Hornik",
            "is_private": false,
            "id": 104547,
